9><c>miracle </c><00:00:07.060><c>of </c><00:00:07.061><c>life </c><00:00:07.062><c>the </c><00:00:07.063><c>RO  </c><00:00:07.064><c>once </c><00:00:07.065><c>said </c><00:00:07.066><c>I </c><00:00:07.067><c>took </c><00:00:07.068><c>a </c><00:00:07.069><c>walk </c><00:00:07.070><c>in </c><00:00:07.071><c>the </c><00:00:07.072><c>woods  </c><00:00:07.073><c>and </c><00:00:07.074><c>I </c><00:00:07.075><c>came </c><00:00:07.076><c>out </c><00:00:07.077><c>taller </c><00:00:07.078><c>than </c><00:00:07.079><c>the </c><00:00:07.080><c>trees  </c><00:00:07.081><c>I </c><00:00:07.082><c>wonder </c><00:00:07.083><c>what </c><00:00:07.084><c>some </c><00:00:07.085><c>time </c><00:00:07.086><c>in </c><00:00:07.087><c>nature </c><00:00:07.088><c>might  </c><00:00:07.089><c>mean </c><00:00:07.090><c>for </c><00:00:07.091><c>you</c>

